  "summary": "The JUMO digiLine O-DO S10 is an optical dissolved oxygen sensor with digiLine electronics that can be read directly over Modbus RTU or through a JUMO digiLine master. This map covers the oxygen and temperature readings, status word, compensation values (flash and RAM), unit selection, analog output, serial and float-format settings and identification.",
